{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MYtVPm8noMh0Ku4AGZ5I_w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:17.737847+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MYtVPm8noMh0Ku4AGZ5I_w","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDvq0OE11aiaTqHqpIvdnfo7PuUxdM6B4V1XtnBKFnFdlwDO7lP1GT6zw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p><strong>1</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>HKU Business School Future Leaders Camp</p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>港大经管硕士「首届」</strong></p><p><strong>菁英夏令营</strong><strong>现正招生！</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDRZict1BjR6bicdSd7YKoz3AxaZ31klnicKibiaWy4B2ySO3DbI4Q2rib7bTA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><p>香港大学经管学院秉承百年港大教育理念，透过世界级的师资力量，和与时俱进的课程设置，为广大学子提供前沿且卓越的商科教学。</p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>首届</strong><strong>菁英夏令营</strong><strong>网申系统现已开启！</strong></span>我们鼓励来自世界各地不同教育背景的同学们踊跃报名。加入港大经管夏令营，成为首届营员，获取前沿商科知识，建立有效人际网络，领跑升学赛道，斩获梦校offer！</p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong> 主办方：</strong>香港大学经管学院</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong> 活动地点：</strong>香港大学</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong> 活动时间：</strong>2025年5月6日 - 8日（星期二 - 四）</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong> 参与项目：</strong>会计、会计数据分析、气候治理与风险管理、经济、家族财富管理、金融、金融科技、环球管理、商业分析、市场营销学、可持续会计及金融、财富管理等12个一年全日制硕士课程</p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p><strong>2</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>Future Leaders Camp Highlights</p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>夏令营亮点</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>参加本次夏令营，优秀营员将有机会收获：</p><p><br/></p><p>▶<strong>今年6月获得2026年入学录取通知书</strong>，提前锁定全球顶尖经管学院硕士课程offer；</p><p>▶有机会斩获高达<strong>25万港币</strong><strong>的</strong><strong>入学奖学金</strong>；</p><p>▶<strong>名企实习offer</strong>，提升职场竞争力；</p><p>▶<strong>名师讲坛</strong>，沉浸式体验港大经管讲座，与顶尖教授和业界专家互动交流；</p><p>▶<strong>学长学姐围炉对话</strong>，来自港大学子的真实就读感受分享；</p><p>▶<strong>企业参访</strong>，零距离接触香港商业环境与金融脉动；</p><p>▶<strong>优秀同侪为伍</strong>，共同发掘潜能，成为下一个国际商界精英。</p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><p><strong>3</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>Application Requirements and Deadline</p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请条件及截止日期</strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>01</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>申请人为重点大学优秀本科毕业生（2026年夏季毕业或已毕业），对本科毕业专业无硬性要求，鼓励跨专业申请；</p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>学习成绩优异，总评成绩在该校同年级本专业当中名列前茅，和/或在其他方面有优异表现；</p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>夏令营申请无需本科院校推免资格。</p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><p><strong>申请截止日期：2025年2月24日中午12点整</strong><strong>（北京时间，UTC+8）</strong></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><strong>结果公布日期：2025年3月下旬</strong></p></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p><strong>4</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>Application Materials and Method</p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请材料及申请方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请材料清单：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>1. 官方盖章出具的本科成绩单扫描件</p><p>2. 官方盖章出具的本科成绩排名证明扫描件</p><p>3. 相关英语能力证明证书复印件（如英语四级、六级、托福、雅思等）</p><p>4. 实习证明（如有）</p><p>5. 一段约3分钟的个人陈述视频（详情参考申请系统相关说明）</p><p>6. 身份证明文件</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>申请方式：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>申请人须登录申请系统在线提交申请材料。</p><p>▶<strong>申请通道</strong><strong>：</strong>请点击“阅读原文”，前往申请页面</p><p><em><span>* 注意事项：</span></em></p><p><em><span>请准确填写邮箱地址，结果将以邮件形式通知审核通过的申请者。</span></em></p><p><em><span><br/></span></em></p><p>▶<strong>扫码申请：</strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDMic7UJC93QkaMXRUIZ6ccozOI1ibxGQoXicicgn0mVZZJK7alHOjQM0KBA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><br/></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>费用说明：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>1. 申请费：无</p><p>2. 住宿：免费（由学院统一安排4晚酒店住宿，后续通知详情）</p><p>3. 膳食：部分免费（由学院统一安排部分餐食，后续通知详情）</p><p>4. 交通费及签证费：自费</p><p>5. 参加者需自行承担自由活动等个人消费</p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/42TpoicIVUrFHC86sr4CtqWJeF5dwsGhDiaLQYDgJO7xcGK2zTQxwiaV7WWdXhShiaLZFy8EIa05bhtVhmyPZP4p2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><p><strong>5</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>Future Leaders Camp Overview</p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>解锁更多菁英夏令营详情</strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><p>为了让同学们进一步了解该夏令营的详情，我们的市场推广及招生总监将在线上宣讲会里全面介绍夏令营的<span><strong>申请条件、申请材料、申请方式、费用说明、项目亮点、日程安排</strong></span>等内容。</p><p><br/></p><p>此外，我们的招生团队将与你直接对话，为你<span><strong>答疑解惑</strong></span>，助力你<span><strong>斩获夏令营的offer</strong></span>！</p></section></sect